      "writtenOn": "2021-10-05T16:10:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Updated the Commit message which was garbled for some reason.\n\nThere are lots of packages that are split across different libraries. In AOSP that includes:\n\nandroid.app\nandroid.media\nandroid.net\nandroid.net.wifi\nandroid.os\nandroid.permission\nandroid.provider\nandroid.util\n\nThese are split across some combination of the following bootclasspath_fragments and the non-updatable libraries:\n\ncom.android.media-bootclasspath-fragment\ncom.android.mediaprovider-bootclasspath-fragment\ncom.android.os.statsd-bootclasspath-fragment\ncom.android.permission-bootclasspath-fragment\ncom.android.tethering-bootclasspath-fragment\ncom.android.wifi-bootclasspath-fragment\n\ne.g. android.net is split across com.android.tethering-bootclasspath-fragment and framework-connectivity (which is part of framework-minus-apex).",
